invalid type: string "Cash-back and Card Rewards: Platinum Credit Card: Ongoing 1% cashback on local and international purchases (in-store or online). Past limited debit-card cashback campaigns (e.g. 0.1% for monthly spends of K1,000+ between November 2022 and January 2023). Occasional short-term promotional boosts (e.g. 5% cashback on Black Friday spends of K2,000+ in November 2025).", expected a